{"title":"The Ash Prophet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Ash Prophet is a named <a href=\"#/monster/ash-prophet\">Ash Prophet</a> seen at level 63.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Ash Prophet</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Ash Temple</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 4×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-444\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-ash-prophet\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ash-charm\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f82a451885528bc6a9e6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ash Charm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/35d700aeda6bf8e97e88.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Ash Prophet</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/ash-prophet\">Ash Prophet</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>63</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,428</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>23 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}